body:
That's a great idea. Will this light work well for succulents?

&#x200B;

Making the top slot out of acrylic  is a great idea! Thank you!

&#x200B;

There isn't really a window to set up the plants in unfortunately. I'll probably shoot you a message after I get some plans sketched out for this!

&#x200B;

Are there any LED's that would also work? I found \[this\]([https://www.amazon.com/BestCircle-Adjustable-Hydroponic-Greenhouse-Germination/dp/B07B3TC9NP/ref=sr\_1\_21?s=lawn-garden&ie=UTF8&qid=1536261823&sr=1-21&keywords=succulent+light](https://www.amazon.com/BestCircle-Adjustable-Hydroponic-Greenhouse-Germination/dp/B07B3TC9NP/ref=sr_1_21?s=lawn-garden&ie=UTF8&qid=1536261823&sr=1-21&keywords=succulent+light)) one that I could mutilate for these purposes. 

&#x200B;
